{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe rain has not spared Vienna, and I arrived at the theater late, having neglected the unusual starting time. I missed the opening chorus honoring our good Emperor Franz, which is a pity, though one learns to make the best of it. I did, however, catch the first act of Zelmira. The singing was competent, though I confess the recitative by Donzelli lacked a certain weight. One hears so much in these provinces, yet the spirit of the place remains distinct.\n\nI think of you and the boys in our warm Berlin rooms. The cold here is sharp, but my spirits are not. I hope Ludwig is well and that Karl and Immanuel are applying themselves to their studies with the diligence you so rightly demand of them. Do not worry about me; I am merely a traveler, observing the world as it turns.\n\nYours ever,\nGeorg"}}],"created":1795219019,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":186,"prompt_tokens":937,"total_tokens":1123,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-0rrg0nm5gQSH1qiiwTCxSHgzmYfZG5sb","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":937,"prompt_ms":947.397,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0110960512273213,"prompt_per_second":989.0257199463371,"predicted_n":186,"predicted_ms":4332.687,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.41992972972973,"predicted_per_second":42.698676364113076}}